  "description": "*\"You are the child of the moon. You must go to the moon palace with me.\"* \n\nBora, a high school girl with the ability to see ghosts. One day, the moon rabbit suddenly appears and makes a bombshell announcement. Because of her useless ability, she has never been able to properly date, and she is going to the moon? No! You can't go! I will escape from Mosul!! Will Bora be able to start dating safely?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
